\n428</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> au plus haut point,\nd’une façon supérieure, <span class=\"aut\">Thcr.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Idyl.</span> <span class=\"refch\">27, 43 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Anth.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 448</span>\n||</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sect\"><span class=\"secta\">Cp.</span> <span class=\"grec\">-ότερος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arr.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 26, 9</span>. <span class=\"ital\">Sup.</span> <span class=\"grec\">-ότατος,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Il.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 499,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hés.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Th.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hell.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 5, 3 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">906</span><span class=\"refpb\">b</span> ; <span class=\"aut\">Luc.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">D. deor.</span> <span class=\"refch\">11, 2,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span></div>\n<div class=\"etymrev\"><span class=\"etiqetymrev\">Étym.</span> R.\n<span class=\"ital\">indo-europ.</span> <span class=\"indoeurop\">*h₂eḱ-</span>, pointu, <span class=\"ital\">cf.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">lat.</span> <span class=\"lat\">ācer, ācris,\nācre</span>.</div>\n"}]}